{"bundle_id":"search.29fcf23d490eb6dd09c8","facts":[{"description":"The provider of the assessed component acts as an intermediary distributing the relevant funds in this promotional context. Establishing this regulatory role requires professional judgment.; units: Boolean for the assessed provider and promotional context","name":"provider_is_distributor","type":"bool"},{"description":"The provider offers this particular benefit component to the assessed client at the assessment time; actual payment or receipt is not required. Supply from the offer evidence.; units: Boolean for one component, provider, client and offer time","name":"component_offered_to_client","type":"bool"},{"description":"Offering the assessed component forms part of promoting an identified specific investment product to the client. Classifying the promotional connection requires professional judgment.; units: Boolean promotional relationship for the assessed component","name":"component_promotes_specific_product","type":"bool"},{"description":"Offering the assessed component is linked to promoting a particular type of investment product to the client, including certain fund types or funds offered by certain fund houses. Classifying the type and connection requires professional judgment.; units: Boolean promotional relationship for the assessed component","name":"component_promotes_particular_product_type","type":"bool"},{"description":"The assessed benefit component is substantively classified as a gift for the quoted restriction. A guaranteed return or other incentive requires individual assessment rather than automatic classification; fund return and distributor top-up must be distinguished where relevant. Supplying this classification requires professional judgment.; units: Boolean classification of one benefit component","name":"component_is_gift","type":"bool"},{"description":"The assessed component itself reduces fees or charges and is substantively a discount of those fees or charges. A separate discount elsewhere in the offer does not make this fact true. Supplying this classification requires professional judgment.; units: Boolean classification of one benefit component","name":"component_is_fee_or_charge_discount","type":"bool"}],"interpretations":[{"basis":"reviewer_interpretation","id":"reading","issue_ids":[],"source_span_ids":["s.db43e253bea18.u0.2","s.db43e253bea18.u7.1360","s.db43e253bea18.u12.2646","s.db43e253bea18.u13.2987"],"statement":"Unreviewed interpretation: [TRUE_IS_PROHIBITED] For an assessed distributor within scope, the result answers whether offering this particular benefit component to the client falls within the quoted gift restriction: the component is offered in promoting a specific investment product or a particular type of investment product, is classified as a gift, and is not a discount of fees or charges. True means that this component's offer falls within that restriction. False means that the conjunction is not met for this component; it does not establish that the combined offer is compliant or legally approved. Unknown inputs remain unknown unless the expression can be determined from the other inputs."}],"rules":[{"body":{"args":[{"name":"component_offered_to_client","node_id":"body.2","op":"fact"},{"args":[{"name":"component_promotes_specific_product","node_id":"body.4","op":"fact"},{"name":"component_promotes_particular_product_type","node_id":"body.5","op":"fact"}],"node_id":"body.3","op":"any"},{"name":"component_is_gift","node_id":"body.6","op":"fact"},{"arg":{"name":"component_is_fee_or_charge_discount","node_id":"body.8","op":"fact"},"node_id":"body.7","op":"not"}],"node_id":"body.1","op":"all"},"id":"selected.control","interpretation_id":"reading","scope":{"name":"provider_is_distributor","node_id":"scope.1","op":"fact"},"source_span_ids":["s.db43e253bea18.u0.2","s.db43e253bea18.u7.1360","s.db43e253bea18.u12.2646","s.db43e253bea18.u13.2987"],"type":"bool"}],"source_spans":[{"end":495,"id":"s.db43e253bea18.